  exerciseName: NotCollidingWalls
  exerciseTitle: Not colliding with walls
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458659
  exerciseText: Player is not colliding with walls
  hintText: Do the walls have colliders?
  solutionText: Walls have 3D colliders, and the player is marked as Kinematic which
    means the Physics system cannot apply forces to it.
